# snow CLI deploy bundle
output/

# Generated catalog data, and a guard rather than a preference: access-codes.json holds
# the codes that gate the live demos, and three of the repo detail files carry those same
# codes inside captured upstream commit messages. This repo is public, so the directory
# cannot be committed as it stands, and it was previously untracked only by luck — one
# `git add -A` away from publishing all 51 of them.
#
# Rebuild it with the scripts in scripts/ rather than expecting git to restore it. Note
# that `npm run refresh` opens by deleting the directory outright, so it is worth a copy
# elsewhere before running that.
data/

# Screenshots, ~24MB across 269 files. Left out to keep the repo clone-able rather than
# for any secrecy reason; regenerate with scripts/screenshot-pages.mjs and
# scripts/screenshot-gallery.mjs.
public/shots/
